Return one item per message, every id exactly once:

- verdict "proposal": a bug report, a feature request, or an improvement the team could act on, and that no tracked unit covers. Messages about the same need share a group_key. Give each a title of at most 70 characters (the symptom for a bug, imperative for a feature), a kind (bugfix, feature, improvement, chore), and a one-paragraph summary of the need.
- verdict "attach": about something a tracked unit already covers. Set unit to its label, e.g. U-12.
- verdict "noise": chatter, thanks, questions that were answered, anything not actionable.

Give each a confidence between 0 and 1, and a one-sentence reason.
